%% state_crisis_mode.mmd
%% State-transition diagram for the Killswitch (crisis_mode global override).
%% Shows the system shifting from Normal Ops to Crisis Mode Active and back, with annotations
%% naming the concrete effects per harness/guardrails.yaml crisis_mode block.
%% Companion to talk/killswitch.md and harness/schemas/CrisisModeActivation.json.

stateDiagram-v2

    [*] --> NormalOps

    NormalOps : Normal Ops
    NormalOps : dry_run_default per rules (true in v0)
    NormalOps : write access available subject to co_authorization
    NormalOps : EvalOps confidence flows normally
    NormalOps : telemetry routes through Agent Harness

    NormalOps --> CrisisActivationPending : operator activation (NOC supervisor or key holder)

    CrisisActivationPending : Crisis Activation Pending
    CrisisActivationPending : CrisisModeActivation event emitted
    CrisisActivationPending : waiting up to 5s for agent fleet acknowledgement
    CrisisActivationPending : (acknowledgement_latency_max_seconds in guardrails.yaml)

    CrisisActivationPending --> CrisisModeActive : all expected agents ack within 5s
    CrisisActivationPending --> EscalatedPaging : ack timeout, non-responsive agents listed

    EscalatedPaging : Escalated Paging
    EscalatedPaging : operator may force-kill stuck containers
    EscalatedPaging : or operator may proceed regardless

    EscalatedPaging --> CrisisModeActive : operator overrides

    CrisisModeActive : Crisis Mode Active
    CrisisModeActive : dry_run_default forced_true
    CrisisModeActive : require_human_approval forced_all
    CrisisModeActive : write_access_o2ims revoked
    CrisisModeActive : write_access_smo_tmf921 revoked
    CrisisModeActive : evalops_confidence_floor 0.0
    CrisisModeActive : telemetry_routing manual_queues

    CrisisModeActive --> CrisisDeactivationPending : operator deactivation (multi-key recommended)

    CrisisDeactivationPending : Crisis Deactivation Pending
    CrisisDeactivationPending : diagnostic re-baseline in progress
    CrisisDeactivationPending : agents reload taxonomy and EvalOps state

    CrisisDeactivationPending --> RecoveryDrill : re-baseline complete

    RecoveryDrill : Recovery Drill
    RecoveryDrill : agents continue with elevated approval requirements
    RecoveryDrill : EvalOps confidence climbing back toward normal
    RecoveryDrill : telemetry rejoins Agent Harness routing

    RecoveryDrill --> NormalOps : observation window clean
